  <refsect1>
    <title>Examples</title>

    <para><screen>varlinkctl introspect <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable> io.systemd.ManagedOOM</screen> shows the
    interface definition as served by <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable>, and
